From: Marionette AirDrop driver research
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] observe WMI, LIM and HDD AWDL RX boundaries

Apply after 0006. While its load-time RX experiment flag is enabled, count
all management arrivals and exact AWDL signatures at three existing receive
boundaries. Counters are root-read-only and atomic. No packet contents are
logged, no ownership or forwarding changes, and no filters are relaxed.
WMI absence is not proof of absent RF traffic; use the separate stock monitor
witness to check the same nearby source and social channels.

